# Tags Test

Tests various tag formats: simple tags, key-value tags, and special tags.


## Simple Tags

[ ] Task with single tag #work
[ ] Task with multiple tags #home #personal #urgent
[ ] Task with tag at end of line #end-tag
[ ] Task with #tag-in-middle of text


## Key-Value Tags

[ ] Task assigned to person #person:john
[ ] Task with clock time #clock:9AM
[ ] Task with location #location:office
[ ] Multiple key-value tags #project:alpha #priority:high #status:active


## Tags in Headings

### Project Alpha #project:alpha

[ ] Task under project alpha heading


### Sprint 2026-Q1 #sprint:2026-Q1 #team:backend

[ ] Backend development task


## Invalid Tag Examples (should be treated as normal text)

[ ] Tag without space before#invalid
[ ] Tag without space after #invalid#another
[ ] Tag with invalid chars #invalid@char
[ ] Tag with space #invalid tag


## Tags with Comments

[ ] Task with tags #work #urgent
    /// Comment: This task needs immediate attention
[ ] Another task #home
    Multi-line comment with tags mentioned.
    But tags in comments are just text: #not-a-real-tag


## Key-Value Tags with Values (Phase 5-9)

### String Values

[ ] Task with priority #priority:high
[ ] Task with priority #priority:low
[ ] Task with priority #priority:medium
[ ] Task with owner #owner:john
[ ] Task with owner #owner:alice
[ ] Task with quoted owner #owner:"john doe"
[ ] Task with quoted description #description:"important task"
[ ] Task with status #status:active
[ ] Task with status #status:inactive


### Numeric Values

[ ] Task with estimate #estimate:5
[ ] Task with estimate #estimate:10
[ ] Task with estimate #estimate:3
[ ] Task with estimate #estimate:9.5
[ ] Task with count #count:100
[ ] Task with level #level:1
[ ] Task with level #level:2
[ ] Task with level #level:3


### Multiple Key-Value Tags

[ ] Task with multiple values #priority:high #estimate:10 #owner:john
[ ] Task with mixed quoted #owner:"jane doe" #priority:high #estimate:5.5
[ ] Complex task #project:alpha #priority:urgent #estimate:8 #owner:"team lead"


### Edge Cases

[ ] Task with empty value #status:
[ ] Task with special chars in value #id:task-123 #code:v1_0_0
[ ] Task with numeric string #code:123 #version:2
[ ] Task at end of line #priority:high
